# 2｜Mission、Position、Non-Goals 與 Cross-DOC Boundary
## 2.1 Why a Constitution Exists
PIPD 的核心風險不是「文件不夠多」，而是 **semantic drift、authority ambiguity、claim inflation、premature execution、stale evidence reuse、adapter/provider authority inversion**。DOC-01 因此存在，用來把「什麼是真的、誰能寫、何時能升狀態、現在最多能宣稱什麼、變更後哪些東西失效」固定成可機器驗證的 constitution。
DOC-01 **SHALL** 成為 project/organization Constitution instance 的 semantic anchor；但它不是 runtime orchestrator，也不是 execution admission service。它解決的是「合法狀態與合法宣稱」而不是「替執行者做實作」。
## 2.2 Canonical Responsibility
DOC-01 owns:
- authority and conflict resolution;
- artifact / subject identity invariants;
- canonical lifecycle states and transition legality;
- projection/substate separation;
- base PromotionPredicate;
- claim / claim ceiling;
- canonical ownership and SoD;
- Constitution/profile binding;
- constitutional permission/side-effect categories;
- change, supersession and affected-only invalidation;
- package derivation, split/merge and vertical-slice rules;
- the machine-readable state/authority/change records that express those semantics.
## 2.3 Non-Goals
DOC-01 **MUST NOT**:
- encode target-repository implementation details;
- create a second `TechnologyAdmission` SSOT;
- issue `ExecutionAdmission`;
- self-approve evidence or qualification;
- turn ECP/TQAEP into permission or PASS;
- create a second CI/release authority;
- claim tool/provider/API success is world-effect truth;
- silently fall back to superseded sources;
- require all unrelated packages to complete before an independently eligible vertical slice can execute.
