# R09｜SPEC／LEDGER／DELIVER：Single-subject TraceClosure、可機讀產物與 Consumer ACK
**輸入**：C21 validated SBL proposal、R03 child ledger、C18 266 field adapter map、R06 technology relevance、R08 fixture plans；**輸出**：`SpecProjectionRecord`, `TraceLedgerRecord`, `DeliverableProposal`; **消費者** SBL DOC00/02/04/05/08/11 及 PIPD DOC02 Native reader；**FirstFail** `TRACE_ORPHAN/CLAIM_ESCALATION/DELIVER_UNUSABLE`。
**SPEC（單一 Versioned meaning）**：`{spec_id,kind,source_refs,requirement_ids,pre/post/invariants/errors,typed_payload,acceptance_ref,verification_ref,evidence_expectation_ref,producer,consumer,claimed_stage}`；**LEDGER（可回溯決策）**：`{entry_id,source_clause_hash,original_owner,child_id,pi_field_ref,spec_ref,acceptance_ref,verification_ref,oracle_ref,evidence_expected_ref,trace_edges,decision,tt_ref,claim_ceiling}`；**DELIVER（真正交付草案）**：`{deliverable_id,artifact_kind,content_ref,sha256,writer_id,consumer_id,ack_state,installation_path,usage_command,readback_plan,rollback_plan,release_claim}`。所有 Native Writer 與自己下游匹配，不把三表變成三個互競 Source of Truth。
