## R08-03.3｜11 項本冊直接責任 U28.1～U31.3：不互代的判準
`U28.1` distinct conversation **仍不足以作 Principal SoD**，必額外 Checker UUID/Credential；`U28.2` 冷凍讀集 mount + digest 比對；`U29.1` PI trace per atom；`U29.2` 真 RepoContext/PD；`U29.3` PIPD DOC07 原生 Oracle/ALL；`U29.4` Source/Subject/Raw 同一 Candidate；`U30.1` Finding immutable state/Counterevidence；`U30.2` 對 Acceptance Owner 可讀報告、有 Owner signed ACK/NACK；`U31.1` Ledger raw 證據；`U31.2` 具名 findings；`U31.3` 有界 Cone 與 requalification closure。十一者任一缺欄是其自己專屬 `U_ATOM_<ID>_CONSUMER_MISMATCH`，不可用別項成功覆蓋。
# R08-04｜FirstFail Reducer：原生 Gate Rank 與 SBL 安全語義分離
Reducer 僅處理 SBL proposal findings。任何 `origin=Native` finding：必提供 PIPD DOC03 真 `NativeRankLookup` 版本/digest/Owner 簽章；沒有就輸出 `NATIVE_RANK_UNBOUND`、`HOLD`，不得把 SBL 排序冒充 Native 法位。對純 SBL 自有錯誤，穩定排序：`HARD_SECURITY_DENY → ORIGINAL_OWNER_NAMESPACE → MISSING_SOURCE/ORACLE → MISSING_RAW → SEMANTIC/PREDICATE`；同一類按 `source_ref, case_id, code` 字典序，digest 採 canonical JSON UTF-8/SHA256，輸出 exactly one first_fail + ALL digest。
```python
import json, hashlib
RANK = {'SECURITY': 0,'NAMESPACE':1,'SOURCE_OR_ORACLE':2,'EVIDENCE':3,'SEMANTIC':4}
def reduce_findings(findings,native_rank=None):
    if not findings: return {'first_fail':None,'all_findings_digest':None,'decision':'HOLD_EMPTY_DENOMINATOR'}
    if any(x['origin']=='NATIVE' for x in findings) and not native_rank:
        return {'first_fail':'NATIVE_RANK_UNBOUND','decision':'HOLD','all_findings_digest':hashlib.sha256(json.dumps(findings,sort_keys=True).encode()).hexdigest()}
    ordered=sorted(findings,key=lambda x:(native_rank.get(x['code'],999) if x['origin']=='NATIVE' else 1000+RANK[x['category']],x['source_ref'],x['case_id'],x['code']))
    blob=json.dumps(sorted(findings,key=lambda x:(x['source_ref'],x['case_id'],x['code'])),sort_keys=True,separators=(',',':'),ensure_ascii=False).encode('utf-8')
    return {'first_fail':ordered[0]['code'],'all_findings_digest':hashlib.sha256(blob).hexdigest(),'decision':'DENY_OR_HOLD'}
