|---:|---|---|
| 1 | `SECURITY_BOUNDARY` | `SECURITY_BOUNDARY` first if observed; all later findings retained as `secondary_findings` |
| 2 | `PERMISSION_OR_HUMAN_TOKEN` | `PERMISSION_OR_HUMAN_TOKEN` first if observed; all later findings retained as `secondary_findings` |

