**Consumer Ack Parser (design)**：`validate_consumer_ack(claim, native_trust_root)` 須實際驗 `issuer`, `principal`, `signature`, `subject_sha256`, `abi_version`, `expiry`, `revocation`, `recipient`, `receiver_mode`, `exact_artifact_sha`, `raw_receipt`, Native Consumer Registry；失任一項結果 `NACK_* / ACCEPT_DESIGN_REFERENCE_ONLY`。`ACCEPT_DESIGN_REFERENCE_ONLY` 僅表示有效的 SBL 設計參考被合法 Reader 收到，不發生 W3 合格、Host 已安裝或 DOC12 Release。正例需真 issuer+same hash+current schema+fresh readback；本輪無 Native Producer 故只可測 NEG 與保留 EXPECTATION。
